{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Db]Look upon Jesus, sinless is He; Father, impute His [Ab]life unto me.[Ab7]
[Db]My life of scarlet, my sin and [Gb]woe, Cover with [Db]His life, [Ab7]whiter than [Db]snow.
[Ab7]Cover with [Db]His life, [Gb]whiter than [Gb]sno[Db]w; [Eb]Fullness of [Eb7]His life then shall I [Ab]kno[Ab7]w;
[Db]My life of scarlet, my sin and [Gb]woe, Cover with [Db]His life, [Ab7]whiter than s[Db]now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Db]Cover with [Ab]His life, [Ab7]whiter than snow;
[Db]Fullness [Gb]of His [Db]life [Ab7]then shall [Db]I know;
[Ab7][Db]My [Gb]life [Gb]of [Db]scarlet, [Eb]my [Eb7]sin [Ab]and [Ab7]woe,
[Db]Cover [Gb]with [Db]His life, [Ab7]whither [Db]than snow.
